<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on Guangzhou Inv.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Guangzhou Inv.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong Branch said on Monday it is issuing 550 million American-style call warrants on shares of Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$3.285	 PREMIUM	    17.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.09972     GEARING	    3.66X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.APR.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  28.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     30.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$3.65	  MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
